# CQ-22 in SAREF Core v4.1.1 -- PARTIAL.
# This is SAREF's home ground: saref:Function, saref:Command, saref:hasCommand
# and saref:isCommandOf express the commands that implement a curtailment, and
# the query returns all three. What it cannot return is the SEQUENCE. SAREF
# Core declares no ordering, step or successor property, so the second column
# the gold answer requires (step order) has no term to bind.
PREFIX saref: <https://saref.etsi.org/core/>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?command WHERE {
  ?device saref:hasFunction ?function .
  ?function saref:hasCommand ?command .
}
ORDER BY ?command
